# restcountries.com v5 API key (https://restcountries.com/docs/countries)
# The legacy free/unauthenticated API was shut down; get a key at
# https://restcountries.com/sign-up
#
# NOTE: do NOT set NODE_ENV=production here — this site's Dockerfile runs
# `npm install` at container start (see entrypoint.sh), and NODE_ENV=production
# makes npm skip devDependencies (typescript, tailwind, ...), which breaks
# the `@/*` import alias resolution during `next build`.
# No quotes: docker-compose's env_file passes values through literally.
RESTCOUNTRIES_API_KEY=your-api-key-here
